OL,3,AMore than 800 missing in Nepal as
OL,4,Aauthorities say glacial collapse
OL,5,Atriggered flash flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescuers are looking for survivors
OL,8,Fafter a massive flash flood on the
OL,9,FNepal-Tibet border, with homes
OL,10,Fdestroyed and bridges swept away by
OL,11,Fsurging mud and water
OL,13,FMore than 800 people are missing in
OL,14,FNepal and at least 177 bodies have been
OL,15,Frecovered so far, with rescue efforts
OL,16,Fcomplicated by rain and geography
OL,18,FIn Tibet, at least 558 people are
OL,19,Fmissing, with three confirmed dead -
OL,20,Fit's not clear if these figures overlap
OL,21,Fwith Nepal's
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
